Effects in forge-arsenal-fx.bundle come from Unity Asset Store packs and are shipped only inside this built bundle; the packs' own files are not
redistributed. Pack, licence as recorded by the effect library, effects used:

Forge own effects
  Forge's own effect, generated by ForgeVfxOwnEffects.cs
  arm_blink, beam_burn, beam_charge, blast_column, blast_debris, foam_burst, gas_burst, pulse_ring, return_glint, rise_foam, rise_mine, scatter_pop, strike_beam, trail_smoke

Free Quick Effects Vol 1
  Standard Unity Asset Store EULA (may ship inside built mod bundles; raw assets must not be redistributed or committed)
  黄橙爆炸火球

Inferno VFX
  Standard Unity Asset Store EULA (may ship inside built mod bundles; raw assets must not be redistributed or committed)
  橙红大型爆炸, 橙红小型爆炸, 橙色大型熔岩地面, 橙色火球爆裂

Master MagicFX Bundle 1.0
  Unity Asset Store EULA（只能随构建发布，不能分发原素材）
  橙色激光起始环, 绿色骷髅毒雾地面圈, 黄橙火焰弹, 黄红火焰子弹

Particle Pack Starter Assets
  Standard Unity Asset Store EULA (may ship inside built mod bundles; raw assets must not be redistributed or committed)
  灰白大型水花喷溅

War FX
  Standard Unity Asset Store EULA (may ship inside built mod bundles; raw assets must not be redistributed or committed)
  blast_debris, trail_smoke, 橙红小型爆炸, 橙色步枪枪口光晕, 橙色步枪枪口闪光, 泥土命中尘土

